            "body": "## Code Review\n\nThis pull request explicitly casts the is_static_input_scheme variable to a boolean across several quantization scheme initializations in compressed_tensors.py. While this ensures type consistency, a critical issue was identified where the code may raise an AttributeError if input_quant is None. The helper methods used in the conditional checks do not currently handle None values, which needs to be addressed to properly support weight-only quantization schemes.",
