      "body": "V4-Pro confirmation: this patch is also load-bearing for serving [`canada-quant/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-NVFP4-FP8-MTP`](https://huggingface.co/canada-quant/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-NVFP4-FP8-MTP) on vLLM mainline `@39910f2b25` + #42209. The V4-Pro FP8 attention path passes through `compressed_tensors.py:is_static_input_scheme` at the same 5 sites the patch fixes; without the `bool()` wrap, downstream code that uses the result as a boolean gets a `QuantizationArgs` object reference instead, and the failure surfaces at unrelated indices.\n\nPatch applies cleanly to current main; the V4-Pro install script ([install_vllm_with_patches.sh](https://github.com/canada-quant/dsv4-pro-nvfp4-fp8-mtp/blob/main/scripts/install_vllm_with_patches.sh)) bundles this alongside #43288, #43290, #43319 for users serving V4-Pro from mainline.\n",
